.TH SECRETLIN 1 "October 2026" "secretlin 1.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
secretlin \- encrypted password manager with a graphical interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B secretlin
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B secretlin
opens a window to store logins (site, user name, password) in a local
vault protected by a master password. The vault is encrypted with
AES-256-GCM; the key is derived from the master password with Argon2id.
.PP
The master password is never stored: if it is lost, the vault cannot be
recovered.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/GestionnaireMDP/coffre.vault
The encrypted vault.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/peterpan1-sudo/SecretLin
